  "description": "<p><strong><span style=\"color: #E67E23;\">FEATURES</span></strong></p><p><strong><span style=\"color: #000000;\">REFLECTIVE SILVER METALLIC COATING</span></strong> - Get a premium high gloss silver sheen with simple brushing.</p><p><img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0681/9672/8915/files/spp_shopify20261027173639_188476004f5bf7b1db3e5d73a9743f2c.png?v=1793093803\"></p><p><strong><span style=\"color: #000000;\">CORRODED METAL RUINS DECOR</span></strong> - Oxidized outdoor iron railings and rusted pipes look worn.</p><p><img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0681/9672/8915/files/spp_shopify20261027173644_29723819875a950fa42ec951218cc820.png?v=1793093809\"></p><p><strong><span style=\"color: #000000;\">STRONG ADHESION PREVENTS FLAKING</span></strong> - Coating bonds tightly to wood and metal without cracking.</p><p><img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0681/9672/8915/files/spp_shopify20261027173650_8ac208b8409492658996b5b4343f7237.png?v=1793093815\"></p><p><strong><span style=\"color: #000000;\">BRILLIANT MIRROR SILVER SHEEN</span></strong> - Turn simple plaster and wooden items into stunning metallic art.</p><p><img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0681/9672/8915/files/spp_shopify20261027173656_9098668c9ea97d16b19d7374c669f126.png?v=1793093821\"></p><p><strong><span style=\"color: #000000;\">ULTRA FINE METALLIC FORMULA</span></strong> - Rich silver micro-particles create a seamless reflective texture.</p><p><img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0681/9672/8915/files/spp_shopify20261027173702_a4f1312598bd947e904620937bd47645.png?v=1793093827\"></p><p><strong><span style=\"color: #000000;\">TOUGH CORROSION RESISTANT SHIELD</span></strong> - Tough protective lacquer coating withstands harsh outdoor elements.</p><p><img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0681/9672/8915/files/spp_shopify20261027173708_152eb995ece873e392a16202685060fc.png?v=1793093833\"></p><p><strong><span style=\"color: #000000;\">WATER BASED PROTECTIVE COATING</span></strong> - Single hundred-gram container easily covers multiple home accents.</p><p><img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0681/9672/8915/files/spp_shopify20261027173715_33b15154e83b8112dfb5bfb4f919fdf4.png?v=1793093840\"></p><p><strong><span style=\"color: #000000;\">SIMPLE THREE STEP APPLICATION</span></strong> - Clean surface and apply coats evenly for mirror finish.</p><p><img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0681/9672/8915/files/spp_shopify20261027173720_004e91909c4b96e3e4ab577c456e5621.png?v=1793093845\"></p><p><strong><span style=\"color: #E67E23;\">SPEC</span></strong></p><p>Color: -</p><p>specifications: -</p><p>size: -</p><p><strong><span style=\"color: #E67E23;\">PACKAGE INCLUDES</span></strong></p><p>1 x Water-based paint silver powder paint decoration silver water paint metallic paint flash silver foil paint special silver paint outdoor antirust paint</p><p><strong><span style=\"color: #E67E23;\">NOTES</span></strong></p><p>Color may not appear exactly as in real life due to variations between computer monitors.</p>",
